WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:05.920
The Trump campaign and right wing media have&nbsp;
been falling all over themselves over the last 24&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:12.960
hours to promote a story by The New York Post, a&nbsp;
supposed game changing, earth shattering bombshell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:19.520
about Joe Biden. And the entire story may be fake.&nbsp;
At minimum, it is not what we would call reputable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:24.080
reporting. And I've gone back and forth over the&nbsp;
last 12 hours about whether to talk about this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:30.320
today. I've received enough e-mails about this&nbsp;
that I do want to discuss it at least briefly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:37.280
So I want to give you the simplest explanation of&nbsp;
the story as it is alleged. First, then we'll talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:43.600
about what we actually know to be true and whether&nbsp;
this story matters. So the story is as follows.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:49.680
Yesterday, The New York Post publishes an article&nbsp;
based on suppose it emails reportedly obtained&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:55.120
from a laptop that Joe Biden's son, Hunter&nbsp;
Biden, had allegedly left at a computer repair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.120 --> 00:01:01.200
shop in Delaware in April of twenty nineteen.&nbsp;
So already we have a lot of if ands and buts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:09.680
speculation and unproven assertions. The gist of&nbsp;
the supposed emails is that Hunter Biden arranged&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:15.280
for a top Ukrainian energy executive to meet with&nbsp;
Joe Biden, who at the time was the vice president.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Supposedly Boris PSMA adviser Vadim Pisarski&nbsp;
wrote an email to Hunter Biden. And in the email,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.760
Pisarski says to Hunter Biden, Thank you for&nbsp;
inviting me to DC and giving an opportunity to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:36.000
meet your father and spend some time together. So&nbsp;
instantly the Trump campaign and the right have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:43.040
been going crazy saying, si, si, Joe Biden lied.&nbsp;
This was a conflict of interest. Hunter Biden was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:48.080
influence peddling while he was on the board of&nbsp;
this Ukrainian energy company, Berrys WMA. Biden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:54.960
lied. It's all true. Now, if the story is true&nbsp;
exactly as described, it would be a problem for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:01.040
Joe Biden, at least to some degree. Although Trump&nbsp;
and his family have done what Joe Biden is accused&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:06.960
of doing a hundred times over. The Trump is don't&nbsp;
care. There have been no repercussions. But yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:13.120
if this story is true, it would lead to having to&nbsp;
answer some questions, OK? But the thing is that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:19.920
now more serious journalistic entities have looked&nbsp;
at the story. The story may not even be true. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:28.640
first question is what? This laptop, a laptop was&nbsp;
supposedly left 18 months ago in a repair shop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:34.800
and the repair shop owner copied the hard drive&nbsp;
and has now turned it over to Rudy Giuliani and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:41.920
others. It's already very weird. The emails that&nbsp;
are in the story aren't actual screenshots of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:47.920
emails. There is no header in. So there is no&nbsp;
metadata. It's a screenshot of a PDAF. It's a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:54.480
screenshot PDAF. It could be from a real email.&nbsp;
It could be totally fake. We don't know. Next,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.480 --> 00:03:02.720
even if the email that is purported to be an&nbsp;
e-mail to Hunter Biden is a real email to Hunter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:08.240
Biden, it's not clear if the email refers to&nbsp;
something that happened or to something that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:13.760
the Russian executive is hoping happens, he says&nbsp;
in the email. Thank you for inviting me to D.C..&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:19.280
That could be. Thank you for something that took&nbsp;
place or something that maybe could take place.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:24.560
Thank you for giving me an opportunity to meet&nbsp;
your father. Unclear if that actually took place.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:30.560
And we'll get to that next. Even if it is what it&nbsp;
purports to be, there is no indication that Hunter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:36.640
Biden ever replied to the email. And the story&nbsp;
doesn't even allege that Hunter Biden replied.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:43.280
And officials who work for Joe Biden say no such&nbsp;
meeting actually took place. Now, in the meantime,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:50.320
the Biden campaign has said it's conceivable that&nbsp;
at some event, Biden might have shaken hands with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:54.880
this Ukrainian executive along with dozens or&nbsp;
hundreds of other people. This is a defense&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.880 --> 00:04:00.000
Donald Trump often uses. Donald Trump will often&nbsp;
claim he doesn't know somebody. Pictures come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:05.440
out of Trump hugging the guy. And then Trump says,&nbsp;
listen, I take he'd say they've actually said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:10.800
I've taken millions of pictures like that. And the&nbsp;
Trump ists are satisfied with that explanation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:15.440
So they conceivably should be satisfied&nbsp;
with that same explanation here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:20.560
if indeed it is the explanation. And then the&nbsp;
last reason to be skeptical of all of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.400
is that Rudy Giuliani appears to be&nbsp;
behind all of it. Donald Trump's,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:30.720
I guess, still lawyer and henchmen. And I would&nbsp;
be at this point looking at anything that comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

