from Rudy Giuliani with skeptical eyes. In&nbsp;
the end, I think this changes nothing about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:41.280
the election. There are rumors that much more&nbsp;
on Hunter Biden is coming. If that happens,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:46.240
then we will have to examine it and reevaluate&nbsp;
whether it does anything in terms of the election.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:51.680
This story from The New York Post, I think&nbsp;
does nothing in terms of the election.&nbsp;

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:57.440
And if this is the October surprise, it&nbsp;
